+> ## Corrigendum (3 September 2026)
+>
+> Two errors identified in the adversarial review of 25 August 2026 are corrected in this
+> version. **No other statement in this bundle has been re-anchored; everything else remains
+> as at 15 August 2026.**
+>
+> 1. **GL-10-R1 (HSA Best Practices Guide for Medical Device Cybersecurity).** §3F item 46
+>    and §5 item 11 recorded it as "published but NOT YET IN FORCE". It **took effect on
+>    17 August 2026** and has been in force since. It remains expressly non-binding
+>    best-practice guidance, not regulatory guidance. Verified 3 September 2026 against the
+>    guide's own Revision History (p 3) and HSA's medical-device guidance index.
+> 2. **HCSA s 59(8).** §4.2.1 correctly records that s 59(8) never commenced and was
+>    deleted by the Statutes (Miscellaneous Amendments) Act 2022 (Act 31 of 2022) s 24(1)
+>    with effect from 1 November 2022 (S 850/2022), but a later sentence in the same section
+>    ("Key data provisions") still said it "remains in force because PDPA s 44 has never
+>    commenced". That sentence is wrong and has been rewritten.
+>
+> **Health Information Act 2026 status is NOT restated in this bundle.** For the position as
+> at 3 September 2026 — including the e-Gazette queries run and the gazette entries from
+> 15 August to 3 September 2026 — see **`SG-02-currency-pass.md`**.
+
+---
